WEBVTT

00:02:58.049 --> 00:03:01.385
and to create a space
where both have something to contribute,

00:03:01.427 --> 00:03:04.222
not by compromise or zero-sum thinking,

00:03:04.263 --> 00:03:08.559
but by bringing all voices into the room
on a journey to a better future.

00:03:09.060 --> 00:03:12.230
If we apply this framework
to our most pressing challenges,

00:03:12.271 --> 00:03:16.859
we can chart a path forward together
acting on our values in fresh ways,

00:03:16.859 --> 00:03:18.569
in a space of shared action.